#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:238
msgid "Input File Arguments"
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:243
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`FILENAME` is an entry point, which may be an XBRL instance, schema, "
"linkbase file, inline XBRL instance, testcase file, testcase index file."
"  `FILENAME` may be a local file or a URI to a web located file.  For "
"multiple instance filings may be `|` separated file names or JSON list of"
" file/parameter dicts [{\"file\":\"filepath\"}, {\"file\":\"file2path\"} "
"...]."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:256
msgid "user name if needed (with password) for web file retrieval"
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:261
msgid "password if needed (with user name) for web retrieval"
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:267
msgid ""
"FILENAME is a list of files to import to the DTS, such as additional "
"formula or label linkbases.  Multiple file names are separated by a `|` "
"character. "
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:277
msgid ""
"FILENAME is a second entry point when comparing (diffing) two DTSes "
"producing a versioning report."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:286
msgid "FILENAME is the filename to save as the versioning report."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:293
msgid ""
"Load taxonomy packages. Option can be repeated for multiple files. If a "
"directory is specified, all .zip files in the directory will be loaded. "
"(Package settings from GUI are no longer shared with cmd line operation. "
"Cmd line package settings are not persistent.)"
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:304
msgid ""
"Provide non-standard archive manifest file name pattern (e.g., "
"*taxonomyPackage.xml).  Uses unix file name pattern matching.  Multiple "
"manifest files are supported in archive (such as oasis catalogs).  "
"(Replaces search for either .taxonomyPackage.xml or catalog.xml)."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:316
msgid ""
"Skip loading discovered or schemaLocated files matching pattern (unix-"
"style file name patterns separated by `|`), useful when not all linkbases"
" are needed."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:324
msgid "Validation Arguments"
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:330
msgid ""
"Validate the file according to the entry file type.  If an XBRL file, it "
"is validated according to XBRL validation 2.1, calculation linkbase "
"validation if either --calcDecimals or --calcPrecision are specified, and"
" SEC EDGAR Filing Manual (if --efm selected) or Global Filer Manual "
"disclosure system validation (if --gfm=XXX selected). If a test suite or "
"testcase, the test case variations are individually so validated. If "
"formulae are present they will be validated and run unless --formula=none"
" is specified. "
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:359
msgid ""
"Enables OIM validation for XML and iXBRL documents. OIM only formats "
"(`json`, `csv`) are always OIM validated."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:369
msgid ""
"Validates an xBRL-CSV report against its Table Constraints metadata only,"
" without loading the taxonomy or creating facts. Implies --validate."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:379
msgid ""
"Skips loading reports and taxonomies inside report and taxonomy packages."
" Useful for validating package structure without asserting anything about"
" the reports and taxonomies within."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:390
msgid ""
"Specify if base taxonomies should be validated.\n"
"                                         Skipping validation of base "
"taxonomy files which are known to be valid can significantly reduce "
"validation time.\n"
"                                         `disclosureSystem` - (default) "
"skip validation of base taxonomy files which are known to be valid by the"
" disclosure system\n"
"                                         `none` - skip validation of all "
"base taxonomies\n"
"                                         `all` - validate all base "
"taxonomies"
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:404
msgid "Validate testcases against their schemas."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:410
msgid ""
"Specify calculations validations: none - no calculations validation, c10 "
"or xbrl21 - Calc 1.0 (XBRL 2.1) calculations, c10d or xbrl21-dedup - Calc"
" 1.0 (XBRL 2.1) calculations with de-duplication, c11r or round-to-"
"nearest - Calc 1.1 round-to-nearest mode, c11t or truncation - Calc 1.1 "
"truncation mode"
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:425
msgid "Deprecated - XBRL v2.1 calculation linkbase validation inferring decimals."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:432
msgid ""
"Deprecated - pre-2010 XBRL v2.1 calculation linkbase validation inferring"
" precision."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:439
msgid ""
"Deprecated - de-duplication of consistent facts when performing "
"calculation validation, chooses most accurate fact."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:445
msgid ""
"Select Edgar Filer Manual (U.S. SEC) disclosure system validation "
"(strict)."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:452
msgid "Skip walking of calculation tree during EFM validation."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:459
msgid ""
"Specify a disclosure system name and select disclosure system validation."
"  Enter --disclosureSystem=help for list of names or help-verbose for "
"list of names and descriptions. "
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:469
msgid "Select HMRC disclosure system validation."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:475
msgid "Select validation with respect to Unit Type Registry."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:482
msgid ""
"Override disclosure systems Unit Type Registry location (URL or file "
"path)."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:488
msgid ""
"Deprecated - testcase infosets are always compared when a variation "
"provides one."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:494
msgid "Compare instance facts against the instance loaded from the given URI."
msgstr ""

#: arelle/CntlrCmdLine.py:500
